prompts.dressing:
Production sprite atlas for an isometric dark fantasy action RPG, painterly realistic late 1990s Diablo-inspired art with fine textured materials. Transparent alpha background, no backdrop, no text, no symbols. Exactly TEN isolated sprites laid out in 5 equal columns and 2 equal rows, with generous fully transparent gutters; every sprite entirely inside its cell. Wide landscape 2560x1024. Consistent camera looking down 30 degrees, object faces at 45 degrees. Ground contact at lower middle of each cell. Individual readable modest-sized environmental decorations, not buildings, not icons.
Top row left to right:
1. a LOW broad round soot-dark stone fire bowl on three short feet, stacked split logs and a modest warm flame, no pole;
2. a LOW Nordic carved stone fire bowl, snow dust on outer rim, glowing coals and a modest flame, no pole;
3. a LOW hammered bronze fire basin on short feet, mossy base, a few smoldering logs, no pole;
4. a LOW weathered terracotta charcoal brazier on short stone base with copper rim, modest orange coals, no pole;
5. a LOW heavy black iron war-camp fire bowl with rivets, red coals and short flames, no pole.
Bottom row left to right:
1. a small irregular patch of tawny wild grass, low green shrub, two worn cobbles and fallen autumn leaves;
2. a small irregular patch of snowy rocks, dry grass poking through snow and one low juniper shrub;
3. a small irregular patch of marsh reeds, fern fronds, mossy river stones and wet mud, no water rectangle;
4. a small irregular patch of desert bunchgrass, tiny scrub, weathered sandstone rocks and sand;
5. a small irregular patch of volcanic rocks, dry black thorn roots and grey ash.
Ground patches must fade naturally to fully transparent edges, no rectangular or diamond tile edges, no platform. All fires understated and warm. No lanterns, hanging objects, tall pedestals, signs, roofs, people, borders, checkerboard or scenery background. Preserve complete silhouettes and fine alpha edges.
